    "title": "JSON schema for Azure IoT Edge Deployment Template version 4.0 (Edge Agent schema v1.1 + Edge Hub schema v1.2 )",
    "type": "object"
  },
  "description": "Dear Team,\n\nThe current Azure\u202fIoT Edge deployment is set to schema version\u202f1.1 and uses Docker as the runtime. No specific logging options have been configured for the runtime. For the system modules, the Edge\u202fAgent container is pulled from **myregistry.azurecr.io/edgeagent:1.0**, and the Edge\u202fHub container comes from **myregistry.azurecr.io/edgehub:1.0**; the hub is marked as running and is configured to always restart if it stops.\n\nIn addition to the system modules, we have two custom modules deployed. The **tempSensor** module runs a Docker image located at **myregistry.azurecr.io/tempsensor:2.1**, is currently running, and is set to always restart on failure. The **dataProcessor** module uses the Docker image **myregistry.azurecr.io/dataprocessor:3.0**, is also running, and will restart only on failure. Both modules inherit the same Docker runtime as defined for the edge device.",
  "reference_json": {
    "modulesContent": {
      "$edgeAgent": {
        "properties.desired": {
          "schemaVersion": "1.1",
          "runtime": {
            "type": "docker",
            "settings": {
              "loggingOptions": ""
            }
          },
          "systemModules": {
            "edgeAgent": {
              "type": "docker",
              "settings": {
                "image": "myregistry.azurecr.io/edgeagent:1.0"
              }
            },
            "edgeHub": {
              "type": "docker",
              "settings": {
                "image": "myregistry.azurecr.io/edgehub:1.0"
              },
              "status": "running",
              "restartPolicy": "always"
            }
          },
          "modules": {
            "tempSensor": {
              "type": "docker",
              "status": "running",
              "restartPolicy": "always",
              "settings": {
                "image": "myregistry.azurecr.io/tempsensor:2.1"
              }
            },
            "dataProcessor": {
              "type": "docker",
              "status": "running",
              "restartPolicy": "on-failure",
              "settings": {
                "image": "myregistry.azurecr.io/dataprocessor:3.0"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
